  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Community Stabilization in Border Communities through Durable Solutions for Mixed Migration Flows and Effective Border Management between Angola and the Democratic Republic of the Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to contribute to strengthening border management capacity, specifically humanitarian border management, in the Lunda Norte province in Angola, and in addressing the underlying drivers of conflict and migration in Kasai and Kasai Central province in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC). Activities in border regions seek to ensure that border and migration management occurs in accordance with international norms and protection standards. Whilst, in addressing the underlying drivers of irregular migration flows in the DRC and providing durable solutions to returnees, the project seeks to promote economic recovery in the Kasai and Kasai Central provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
